*.mp3
*.flac
*.aac
*.opus
# NOTE: *.wav is intentionally NOT globally ignored. TTS wav output lands in
# the already-ignored sarvam_tts_audio/ folder, while transcribe_sarvam.py
# accepts .wav as INPUT and users may keep .wav assets in the repo; a global
# *.wav ignore would silently hide those input files. Use a dedicated output
# folder (the default) to keep generated wav audio out of git.

